cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "fitspeek: turn a folder of FITS image files into contact-sheet PNGs for triage"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/fitspeek"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/fitspeek"
abstract: >-
  Renders a folder of FITS image files into contact-sheet PNGs: grids of
  thumbnails stamped with filename and key header values, a north/east
  compass where the WCS carries a CD or PC matrix, and an index.csv
  mapping every thumbnail back to its source file.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - FITS
  - contact sheet
  - triage
